{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">無綫節目《美食新聞報道》為觀眾帶來兩大地區的美食推介。前半集由黃嘉雯（Carmaney）夥拍陳國強師傅，前往旺角品嚐由泰國籍主廚主理的正宗泰國菜；後半集則由施焯日（Arthur）與波波（黃婧靈）接棒，帶領大家到尖沙咀東部的人氣小食地段進行「掃街」，嚐盡爆餡泡芙、陝西肉夾饃及厚切黑松露蛋治等特色美食。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>旺角正宗泰國風味</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">首站由黃嘉雯與陳師傅來到位於旺角通菜街的泰國餐館「曼谷小館」。該店由原籍泰國的主廚親自坐鎮，節目中特別推介了多款惹味菜式：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">曼谷小館</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：旺角通菜街123號地下A及B號舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3a232dd9-e8b7-46e2-85be-65a50cbf5759.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026so0jNmap9M1787195682.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3a232dd9-e8b7-46e2-85be-65a50cbf5759.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3f764d48-5f18-4e99-8b8d-d0cad5bb623c.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026rkczXHBXDv1787195682.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3f764d48-5f18-4e99-8b8d-d0cad5bb623c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1f577c71-0d67-4ed7-860b-b6563a2a6842.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026r2gZeQ3XZN1787195682.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1f577c71-0d67-4ed7-860b-b6563a2a6842.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2017a2a2-3efc-488f-a517-afa6f89ca394.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026vZ2VsL8eHP1787195682.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2017a2a2-3efc-488f-a517-afa6f89ca394.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>尖東人氣小食掃街推介</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">隨後，施焯日與波波轉戰尖東熱門小食區，為觀眾發掘了三間特色食店，一網打盡各款中西美食。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">兩人率先造訪這間大排長龍的人氣泡芙店。招牌「焦糖燉蛋泡芙」配上帶鹹香的雲尼拿忌廉，獲得兩位主持給予十分滿分！另外還有醬汁滿溢、榛子香氣濃郁的「巴黎榛子泡芙」，以及能清晰看見雲尼拿籽、奶香極度濃郁的「特濃雲尼拿泡芙」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">主打傳統陝西美食，其「肉夾饃」外皮酥脆，內裡夾滿蒜香十足且多汁的大塊碎肉，極之適合偏好重口味的食客。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"> 節目推介了份量十足的「豬扒包」，原塊豬扒肉比漢堡包還要大，重現傳統經典滋味。此外，賣相極具吸引力的「黑松露蛋治」亦不容錯過，厚蛋嫩滑細緻如日式玉子燒，極濃的蛋香與黑松露香氣完美配合，令人大感滿足。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3bee069a-d9e3-4bad-91ce-3725910a846e.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20263ZgKdEc32R1787195683.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3bee069a-d9e3-4bad-91ce-3725910a846e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f205e76c-5042-4019-b6ca-d687e5f82212.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026SQw5bYy6tg1787195683.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f205e76c-5042-4019-b6ca-d687e5f82212.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"21db4d90-3961-4608-a90e-94a704b92da0.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026AFejAZPFMF1787195683.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"21db4d90-3961-4608-a90e-94a704b92da0.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"32522a50-73c4-4cde-a4ef-ca858268e78c.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026q5Kuv7V7AY1787195682.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"32522a50-73c4-4cde-a4ef-ca858268e78c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"24dbcd5c-71ce-41af-a494-172798040f6e.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026q43xml0AIl1787195683.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"24dbcd5c-71ce-41af-a494-172798040f6e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"11700468-6b21-45e7-a61f-7c9ddabbc850.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20265n2tjnyoyz1787195682.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"11700468-6b21-45e7-a61f-7c9ddabbc850.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Owl's </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choux </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Pastry Patisserie</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">金饃坊</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">德島</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T13:19:37.449885+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":597,"images":10,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}